raye-desktop  release/xdg/autostart/org.kde.kclockd-autostart.desktop  etc/xdg/autostart/org.kde.kclockd-autostart.desktop  divert
raye-desktop  release/tuning/user/speech-dispatcher.service.d/raye-idle.conf  usr/lib/systemd/user/speech-dispatcher.service.d/raye-idle.conf
